coming soon! \n\n\ud83c\udf3d 50+ unique bags & boards to cornhole your way\n\ud83c\udf3d 5 Halls\n\ud83c\udf3d Challengeable NPC Pros in each Hall\n\ud83c\udf3d YouTube-powered jukebox\n\ud83c\udf3d Private & quick match multiplayer\n\ud83c\udf3d 1v1 or 2v2 team battles\n\nBags, sack toss, dummy boards, doghouse, beanbag toss\u2026 no matter what you call it, it\u2019s surely the world\u2019s greatest lawn game. ForeVR Cornhole is the best (and first!) cornhole game for VR!", "short_description": "This year, summer lasts ForeVR!\n\nExperience custom beanbag physics, tailored for all throws and strategies, and optimized for realism. \n\n\ud83c\udf3d 50+ unique bags & boards\n\ud83c\udf3d 5 Halls\n\ud83c\udf3d Challengeable NPC Pros in each Hall\n\ud83c\udf3d YouTube-powered jukebox\n\ud83c\udf3d Private & public multiplayer\n\ud83c\udf3d 1v1 or 2v2 team battles\n\nBags, sack toss, dummy boards, doghouse, beanbag toss\u2026 no matter what you call it, it\u2019s surely the world\u2019s greatest lawn game. ForeVR Cornhole is the best (and first!) cornhole game in VR!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.forevrgames.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://forevrgames.com/tos", "publisher_name": "ForeVR Games Inc", "support_website_url": "http://help.forevrgames.com/", "website_url": "http://forevrgames.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL", "ARCADE", "SPORTS"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING